From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:32:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] webview: confirm private server certificates for one visit

Show the origin and leaf fingerprint when an explicitly opened HTTPS server has an unknown issuer. Bind confirmation to the current WebView, origin and leaf. Cancel other certificate errors and clear native SSL decisions. Cover the shared Anikku screen and activity entry points.
